# What the image build needs is the workspace as cargo sees it: every member
# manifest (including `vendor/ryu`, or `cargo metadata` fails on a missing
# member) and `vendor/postgres/catalog`, which `crabgresql-catalog/build.rs`
# reads through a path relative to its own manifest. Excluding either breaks
# the build rather than slowing it down.

# Build output — the host's `target/` is for the host's triple and is the
# single largest thing in the tree.
/target

# Repository plumbing that no compilation reads.
.git
.github
.claude
.context
.idea
.gitkeep

# The PostgreSQL regression corpus: ~19 MB, used by `crabgresql-pg-regress`,
# which the image does not build. The catalog `.dat` files next to it stay.
vendor/postgres/regress

# Benchmark harness data and scripts — CI territory, not the server image.
scripts/bench

# Prose. `README.md` stays: `crabgresql-config` reads it to check that its
# Configuration table still matches the knobs.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
ROADMAP.md
docs
